{"lines": ["On one stone bridge, dogs suddenly freeze, stare at nothing, and leap fifty feet onto the rocks.", "Overtoun Bridge, Scotland, built in eighteen ninety-five over a deep wooded gorge.", "And it gets stranger. Owners say they jump from the same side, near the same end.", "In twenty fourteen, a spaniel named Cassie stared at something above the bridge, then jumped. Her owner called it sinister.", "Locals claim hundreds of dogs have leapt since the nineteen fifties. But no one kept official records.", "Then an expert tested a theory. Mink nests sat under that side, and seven of ten dogs ran straight for mink scent.", "The solid stone wall hides the drop, so one leap carries a dog over.", "But a local hunter says there are no mink there, and an animal welfare probe found nothing conclusive.", "So is it a scent pulling them over, or something they see that we can't?"], "words": [["On", 0.0, 0.1], ["one", 0.1, 0.28], ["stone", 0.28, 0.56], ["bridge,", 0.56, 0.98], ["dogs", 1.48, 1.72], ["suddenly", 1.72, 2.26], ["freeze,", 2.26, 2.6], ["stare", 3.16, 3.38], ["at", 3.38, 3.6], ["nothing,", 3.6, 3.9], ["and", 3.9, 4.34], ["leap", 4.34, 4.5], ["fifty", 4.5, 4.82], ["feet", 4.82, 5.2], ["onto", 5.2, 5.32], ["the", 5.32, 5.5], ["rocks.", 5.5, 5.7], ["Overtoun", 6.416, 6.88], ["Bridge,", 6.88, 7.3], ["Scotland,", 7.72, 8.04], ["built", 8.68, 8.94], ["in", 8.94, 9.16], ["eighteen", 9.16, 9.436], ["ninety-five", 9.436, 9.78], ["over", 9.78, 10.6], ["a", 10.6, 10.72], ["deep", 10.72, 10.96], ["wooded", 10.96, 11.42], ["gorge.", 11.42, 11.66], ["And", 12.332, 12.38], ["it", 12.38, 12.46], ["gets", 12.46, 12.62], ["stranger.", 12.62, 13.02], ["Owners", 13.88, 14.06], ["say", 14.06, 14.36], ["they", 14.36, 14.54], ["jump", 14.54, 14.82], ["from", 14.82, 15.08], ["the", 15.08, 15.24], ["same", 15.24, 15.46], ["side,", 15.46, 15.88], ["near", 16.22, 16.38], ["the", 16.38, 16.56], ["same", 16.56, 16.82], ["end.", 16.82, 17.08], ["In", 17.568, 17.62], ["twenty", 17.62, 17.809]